@base = http://localhost:8080/api/resources

### 1. List all resources -> 200
GET {{base}}

### 2. Filter: only desks -> 200
GET {{base}}?type=DESK

### 3. Filter: at least 5 people -> 200
GET {{base}}?minCapacity=5

### 4. Filter: location + max price -> 200
GET {{base}}?location=floor 2&maxPrice=50

### 5. Invalid type -> 400
GET {{base}}?type=SOFA

### 6. One resource -> 200
GET {{base}}/1

### 7. Unknown resource -> 404
GET {{base}}/999

### 8. Create a meeting room -> 201
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Innovation Lab",
  "location": "Floor 3",
  "capacity": 12,
  "hourlyRate": 95.00,
  "hasProjector": true,
  "hasVideoConference": false
}

### 9. Create a desk (capacity 5 is ignored -> always 1) -> 201
POST {{base}}/desks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dedicated Desk C1",
  "location": "Floor 3",
  "capacity": 5,
  "hourlyRate": 15.00,
  "deskType": "DEDICATED_DESK"
}

### 10. Invalid room -> 400 (lists all problems)
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "location": "Floor 3",
  "capacity": 0,
  "hourlyRate": -5
}

### 11. Update room 2 -> OUT_OF_SERVICE -> 200
PUT {{base}}/2/room
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Focus Room",
  "location": "Floor 1",
  "capacity": 6,
  "hourlyRate": 45.00,
  "status": "OUT_OF_SERVICE",
  "hasProjector": true,
  "hasVideoConference": true
}

### 12. Update a desk using the ROOM endpoint -> 404 (3 is a desk)
PUT {{base}}/3/room
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "x",
  "location": "y",
  "capacity": 2,
  "hourlyRate": 10
}

### 13. Update desk 3 -> 200
PUT {{base}}/3/desk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hot Desk A1",
  "location": "Floor 1",
  "hourlyRate": 11.00,
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "deskType": "STANDING_DESK"
}

### 14. Delete the desk created in request 9 (no bookings) -> 204
### Check the "id" in the answer of request 9, and change 6 below if it is different
DELETE {{base}}/6

### 15. Delete it again -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/6